<html>
<head>
	<title></title>
</head>
<body style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; height: auto; min-height: auto;">
<div style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; padding-top: 10px; padding-right: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 10px; font-weight: 400; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; color: #OE0F0E;">
<div style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; padding-top: 5px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 0px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:16px;"><strong style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Dear Madam/Sir,</strong></span></div>

<div style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; padding-top: 10px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 0px;">
<p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Thanks for your message — we’ve received it.</p>

<p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">To help you as quickly as possible, we’ve created a case for you. Your case reference number is: {{{Case.CaseNumber}}}</p>

<p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">One of our team members will take a look at your case shortly and will contact you if needed.</p>

<p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">If you have any questions or additional information, feel free to reply to this email.</p>
</div>

<div style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; padding-top: 5px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 0px;">
<p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Best regards,</p>
</div>

<div style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; padding-top: 5px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 0px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color:#ff0000;"><strong style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Team Moving Intelligence</strong></span></div>
</div>
</body>
</html>